## Section A: Execution Pattern Classification

> Programs are classified based on **observable source code indicators only**.
> - 🟢 **ONLINE** = `EXEC CICS` command detected anywhere in program
> - 🔵 **BATCH** = sequential file I/O, `SORT`/`MERGE` verb, checkpoint paragraph, or PERFORM-UNTIL-EOF pattern
> - ❓ **UNDETERMINED** = no conclusive indicator found → requires manual review

